OL,3,GNEWSAFirst phase of education scheme
OL,4,Acost #86m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first phase of a scheme to upgrade
OL,7,Feducation facilities including the
OL,8,Fdevelopment of Guernsey's post-16
OL,9,Fcampus has cost #86m, the government
OL,10,Fhas disclosed.
OL,12,FThe plans to create the new sixth form
OL,13,Fcollege, Les Ozouets campus, in St
OL,14,FPeter Port, are 10 months from
OL,15,Fcompletion, according to deputy Paul
OL,16,FMontague, President of Education, Sport
OL,17,Fand Culture.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
