OL,3,GNEWSAFirst phase of education scheme
OL,4,Acost #86m
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said the "vast majority" of #86.7m
OL,7,Fwas being spent at the Les Ozouets site
OL,8,Fbut that included refurbishment work at
OL,9,FLes Varendes High School and digital
OL,10,Fupgrades at The Guernsey Institute.
OL,12,FHe said funding for the second phase
OL,13,Fhad still not been confirmed so sports
OL,14,Fstudents would remain at Beau Sejour.
